From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in exact reciprocal quantization and fix
 average-subsampling bottom padding

Add Encoder::set_exact_quantization to opt into 16-bit variable-shift
reciprocal quantization matching libjpeg-turbo, and repeat the last
downsampled row at partial-iMCU bottom edges when using
ChromaSubsamplingMethod::Average.

Upstream PR: https://github.com/vstroebel/jpeg-encoder/pull/44

